 man's stiff attitude naturally softens as well."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Hopps","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"???","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Of course. I'm looking forward to it too."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Bramedb","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Hopps","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Bramedb","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Once you send it to the airport, everything will be over."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Bramedb","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Hopps","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"???","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...That moment cannot come soon enough."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Bramedb","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Hopps","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Bramedb","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It's up to you now... Darling."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Hopps","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"???","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_20Winter_Door_Car_Open","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Bramedb laughs, then watches the man get off the vehicle."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_20Winter_Door_Car_Close","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"She leans out of the driver's seat to wave him goodbye, and then closes the door."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_engine_speedup","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Vroom... As the engine roars into life once more, the black car races off."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw